      "message": "FYI kFilterLinear is horizontal only and can be included in this test but I think ScaleFilterReduce has reduced it to kFilterNone by this point",
      "revId": "4b3abc0935c28876f6be915cfe2bc3bf5b63774f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
