      "writtenOn": "2026-08-24T22:19:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, exactly. Since this is the same-width path, ScaleFilterReduce\nreduces `kFilterLinear` to `kFilterNone` before reaching this branch.\n`kFilterBox` is reduced to `kFilterBilinear`, so only `kFilterNone` and\n`kFilterBilinear` reach this upsampling logic.",
      "parentUuid": "6447c657_8520ac33",
      "revId": "4b3abc0935c28876f6be915cfe2bc3bf5b63774f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
